            "review_title": "Review at 40 Hàng Tre",
            "review_text": "Cecilia\nItaly146 contributions\n0\nBest Bánh cuõn and authentic local experience in Hanoi\nAug 2025 • Couples\nBest breakfast experience. We went to 40 Hàng Tre to taste Bun Rieu Cua since it was recommended online, but when we arrived at the restaurant we found 4 locals sitting at the tiny tables in front of the owner cook whom was actually cooking another dish. There were only 2 free seats only, just made for us (6 seats in total) and it made the experience more authentic and intimate. It was felt like we were sitting at family table with local people and it felt very great. We ate Bánh cuõn dish that the woman was cooking and it was really great. We highly recommend to sit at her table.\nRead more\nWritten August 16, 2025",
